# Dark theme tokens

Primitives live in `app/globals.css` `:root`. Do not add hues or one-off RGB.

| Token | Hex | Role |
|---|---|---|
| `--background` | `#000000` | Canvas |
| `--surface` | `#080c12` | Glass / card fill |
| `--foreground` | `#f4f7f9` | Primary ink |
| `--muted` | `#b5c8d2` | Secondary ink |
| `--star` | `#57707d` | Dim star (starfield `0x57707d`) |
| `--star-bright` | `#b4d2dc` | Lit star / labels |
| `--accent` | `#1a7fb8` | Brand accent |

Derived: `--hairline` (foreground 16%), `--hero-panel` (surface 28%).

Tint with `color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 16%, transparent)`. Alphas only: **12 / 16 / 28 / 55 / 70 / 90**. Tailwind: `text-muted`, `border-hairline`, `text-accent`.

```css
/* BAD */
color: rgb(181 200 210 / 0.58);
border: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 0.17);

/* GOOD */
color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--muted) 55%, transparent);
border: 1px solid var(--hairline);
```

Exceptions: solid white on `.btn-primary` and the cursor core; `app/mindfully/` light theme; official skill-icon brand hexes.
